    "body": "## Changes\n\nFour small, independent pieces of serving infrastructure that came out of a long engine bring-up. Grouped in one PR because they share the same startup hook in `api_server.py`.\n\n### 1. HEAD probe (`api_server.py`)\n\nLoad balancers and Kubernetes readiness probes commonly use `HEAD /`. vLLM had no route for it and answered **405**, so the probe declared the pod dead and traffic was drained — even though the server was healthy.\n\n```python\n@app.head(\"/\")\n@app.head(\"/{path:path}\")\nasync def _head_probe(path: str = \"\") -> Response:\n    return Response(status_code=200)\n```\n\nAnswers 200 on every path without executing request logic.\n\n### 2. Startup log mirror (`logger.py`, `api_server.py`)\n\nA cold start takes several minutes and its lines are interleaved with runtime traffic in one large file, so diagnosing a failed start means scrolling through tens of thousands of lines.\n\n`_StartupLogHandler` writes a copy of the vLLM logger's messages to its own file and **detaches itself** once `Application startup complete` is seen — no runtime cost afterwards. Path overridable via `VLLM_STARTUP_LOG_FILE`.\n\n### 3. Guarded cache reclamation (`_sm70_startup_cleanup.py`)\n\nRuns before any worker spawns and reclaims the `torch_compile_cache` tree plus stale `/dev/shm` offload files.\n\nTriple-gated, because deleting shared caches is only safe under specific conditions:\n- `VLLM_SM70_STARTUP_CACHE_CLEANUP` (default on)\n- `VLLM_DISABLE_COMPILE_CACHE=1` (reuse off)\n- **every GPU idle** — an engine may be running elsewhere\n\nFiles still mapped by any process are never removed (checked via `lsof`, falling back to a `/proc/*/maps` scan). Under the default configuration (reuse enabled) it is completely inert.\n\n### 4. Model card capabilities (`models/serving.py`)\n\n`context_window` and `max_output_tokens` were absent from the model card, so clients had to hardcode them. They are now derived from `max_model_len` in three tiers (90/10, 85/15, 80/20 split at 50K and 100K).\n\n## Testing\n\n- HEAD / returns 200; readiness probes stay green.\n- Startup file stops growing once the server is up.\n- With reuse enabled the cleanup logs a skip and touches nothing; with reuse disabled on an idle GPU it reclaims; with an engine resident it skips.",
